1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:02,850
Two sounds just became a word.

2
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:05,230
Today you're going to do that sixteen times.

3
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:06,960
Blending is easy.

4
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:09,840
Say the sounds apart…

5
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:11,480
…then squeeze them together.

6
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:12,880
Slow first.

7
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:16,860
Fast after.

8
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,260
Red box is a vowel.

9
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:20,320
Blue box is a consonant.

10
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:23,500
When the vowel goes first, we get these.

11
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:25,660
Eight words.

12
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:27,440
Vowel first, every time.

13
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:29,340
Now flip it.

14
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,420
Consonant first.

15
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:32,840
Eight more.

16
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:34,900
Consonant first, every time.

17
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:37,470
Here's the secret.

18
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:39,540
These aren't just little words.

19
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:42,700
Put a sound in FRONT of them…

20
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:43,720
And the other eight?

21
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:46,020
Put the sound at the BACK.

22
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:48,880
You didn't learn sixteen little words.

23
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:51,620
You learned sixteen word machines.

24
00:00:52,540 --> 00:00:53,600
Blended along with me?

25
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:56,660
Tap the thumbs up — I want to know you did it!

26
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:58,100
Your turn.

27
00:00:58,500 --> 00:00:59,360
Blend it with me.

28
00:01:00,740 --> 00:01:02,760
Last one — which word is this?

29
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:04,840
Cup!

30
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:07,140
You blended a whole word by yourself.

31
00:01:07,900 --> 00:01:14,340
Hit subscribe, because next time we blend THREE sounds — cat, dog, pig.

32
00:01:15,460 --> 00:01:22,880
Blend all sixteen yourself in English Learning — tap the boxes, hear every sound, free on both stores.
